# Payment, Wallet, Review Endpoints

> Phan nay la **API contract** cho frontend. Module payment/wallet/review chua co controller (chi co .gitkeep). Khi implement phai cap nhat docs/api/api-document.md va muc nay.

## 46.14 Payment (/api/v1/payments)

> Module payment/controller/ chua co - placeholder. Xem payment.mdc.

- POST /api/v1/payments/{orderCode} - Buyer tao payment intent.
- POST /api/v1/payments/callback - Gateway callback (public, signed).
- GET /api/v1/payments/{id} - Buyer xem payment.

## 46.15 Wallet (/api/v1/wallets)

> Module wallet/controller/ chua co - placeholder. Xem wallet.mdc.

- GET /api/v1/wallets/me - Xem vi cua toi.
- GET /api/v1/wallets/me/transactions - Lich su (paging).
- POST /api/v1/wallets/me/topup - Tao yeu cau nap.
- POST /api/v1/wallets/me/withdraw - Tao yeu cau rut.

## 46.16 Review (/api/v1/...)

> Module review/controller/ da co ProductReviewPublicController (GET public) - xem review.mdc.

- POST /api/v1/products/{productId}/reviews - Authenticated (placeholder).
- GET /api/v1/products/{productId}/reviews - Public, paging, filter by rating/hasMedia, ratingDistribution + mediaCount (Subplan 3).
- GET /api/v1/users/me/reviews - Buyer xem review cua minh (placeholder).
- DELETE /api/v1/reviews/{id} - Owner hoac Admin (placeholder).

